+    "For recovered, stale, or insufficient evidence, choose Other and explain "
+    "the limitation. Cite "
+    "source records available by the task reference time. Set each citation "
+    "observedAt to the source record's observation time, or the event timestamp "
+    "for a log row. Treat ingestion, later export and query timestamps as "
+    "separate facts, and keep citation windows within the task reference time. "
+    "Bound diagnosis and coverage claims to the returned records and identify "
